    "created_at": "2016-06-21T19:07:49Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-06-21T19:07:49Z",
    "body": "Thanks for sharing these references. Worldwide there are still a lot of different codes used in various countries. However, many countries now use solely IBAN/BIC for bank transfers which is the only system being available in most countries world-wide.\nSo I assume it would make sense to introduce an IBAN/BIC code rather than a universal field description that then accepts any kind of number, which would make it very hard to determine what kind of transfer this indicates.\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
