    "created_at": "2016-06-23T09:05:40Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-06-23T09:05:40Z",
    "body": "What are the security implications? For example, I wonder whether it would be possible to hide IBAN/BIC fields from the user (e.g. by positioning something else over the field) but make the user autofill them anyway, because the user thinks he is justing autofilling his name and e-mail address, for example when writing a comment on a  blog.\n",
