    "updated_at": "2016-06-24T09:51:56Z",
    "body": "It does not differ from credit card security indeed. Note that IBAN/BIC does not have a security code (such as a CVV/CVC for credit cards) but the bank requires the company that want so transfer the money away to have a user-consent for it.\n",
